Description:It is your first main phase and you have not played a land. Flame Jab (1 damage to any target; retrace) is in your graveyard, you have two Mountains in hand, and two red mana floating. The opponent is at 2 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-retrace-discard-land | Retrace lets you cast the card from your graveyard by discarding a land card as an additional cost (CR 702.81a): discard each Mountain to cast Flame Jab twice for 2; playing a Mountain as your land drop gives a third mana but leaves only one land card to discard, so only 1 damage
